  description: Born among peoples who value strength above scholarly pursuits, Barbarians
    cultivate their bodies through hardship, battle and relentless physical trials.
    Though often dismissed as uncivilised by Imperial scholars, their instinctive
    command of Aura makes them formidable warriors. Where others rely upon refined
    techniques, the Barbarian relies upon overwhelming might.
